 {'cluster':'Mercedes broad service','a':BASE+'/services/mercedes-service-dubai','b':BASE+'/brands/mercedes-benz-service-dubai','owner':BASE+'/brands/mercedes-benz-service-dubai','evidence':'Live old service URL returns 200 without changing URL, with homepage title/canonical.','type':'Observed routing defect','action':'Confirm the intended alias and serve one permanent redirect to the hub. No change made.'},
 {'cluster':'Generic garage / nearby garage','a':BASE+'/services/car-garage-dubai','b':BASE+'/services/garage-near-me-dubai','owner':BASE+'/services/car-garage-dubai','evidence':'Both live pages target finding an Al Quoz garage with overlapping service lists. Query-to-page competition is not in the export.','type':'Content-overlap hypothesis','action':'Keep broad workshop intent on car-garage; make nearby access/location content distinct. Consider consolidation only after joint query/page data.'},
 {'cluster':'Paint protection comparison versus PPF','a':BASE+'/services/paint-protection-dubai','b':BASE+'/services/paint-protection-film','owner':BASE+'/services/paint-protection-film','evidence':'The broad hub compares paint care options; the PPF page owns film. Related mentions alone are not cannibalization.','type':'Differentiated intents; retain','action':'Retain comparison hub ownership of mixed protection queries and film ownership on PPF. No redirect or canonical merger.'},
 {'cluster':'Ceramic versus PPF','a':BASE+'/services/ceramic-coating','b':BASE+'/services/paint-protection-film','owner':BASE+'/services/ceramic-coating','evidence':'Dedicated live pages already distinguish coating from physical film.','type':'Differentiated intents; retain','action':'Ceramic variants stay on coating; film variants stay on PPF. Keep useful comparison links.'},
